Mon Nov 16 12:48:09 UTC 2026 - Caio César Ortega <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- update to 3.5.3
  * Fixed Internal Error when pressing unassigned up/down keys in the
    programmable menu (regression from 3.5)
  * Copy and Paste handles linefeeds consistently and no longer loses
    text embedded in matrices and lists
  * Functions invoked via direct XEQ mapping in skins leave the program
    counter in place and no longer cancel the programmable menu

