Sun Nov  8 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of Free42 3.5.2 for openSUSE Leap 16.0
  * Build both free42dec (Intel decimal library) and free42bin
  * Enable ALSA audio (libasound.so.2 is dlopen()ed, with a
    gdk_beep() fallback, so no explicit dependency)
  * Add desktop entries and hicolor icons
